# A step that writes a file and reads it back in one body hands on what it read: the read is of the file as the step
# left it, inside the step, and the place keeps what the step leaves there, in the codomain (rule 4, #64).

route onebody.run
step run/note

line entry > run call
line run/note > File(data/log.txt) own
line run/note > run back                                 # note returns what it read; run prints it
line run > Screen own

side entry left
side File(data/log.txt) right
side Screen right
